# MEMORY DISCIPLINE — brain/CONTEXT.md FORMAT

```
# Jonatech Docs Agent — Brain

## STATUS   (one true answer per fact — REWRITE in place, never accumulate)
- Active brand: jonatech-digital
- Render target: Paper drafts file "Jonatech Digital — Documents"
- Current model: grok-4-fast (xai)

## DECISIONS (append-only, dated, immutable)
- 2026-11-20: v0.1 scope locked to PROPOSALS ONLY (Jonatech, time constraint).
- 2026-11-20: Demo brand = Jonatech Digital real assets.
```

STATUS = state (rewritten). DECISIONS = history (appended). **Never mix the two verbs.**

