# DEMO SCRIPT (docs/demo/ — rehearse ≥3 times, P3)

**Rig:** laptop, Paper Desktop open (fresh account, file "Jonatech Digital — Documents"), ui.py chat LEFT half of screen, Paper canvas RIGHT half. Hotspot in the bag (model call needs internet; everything else is local).

**Beat 1 — WORK (60s):** Type: *"Proposal for Ronnie — the Cursor workshop training gig, $500, our standard terms."* → branded proposal appears on canvas. Say: "On brand, first try. It knows my rates — nobody typed them."

**Beat 2 — CO-BUILD (90s, THE MOAT):** Judge or Jonatech drops a comment: *"logo too small — and add your TIN."* → type: *"fix my comments"* → agent reads, edits layers, verifies by screenshot, resolves both. Say: "It reads the canvas, we edit together — and watch this next part."

**Beat 3 — MEMORY (45s, THE KILL SHOT):** Kill the agent process. Relaunch. Type a NEW proposal request. The TIN rule from the dead session applies itself. Say: **"The chat died. The brain didn't."**

*(Optional Beat 4 if clock allows: hand it a proposal layout screenshot — study_inspiration — "like this, but in MY brand.")*

**Pitch close:** "Every builder here burns an evening formatting proposals. This hands the evening back. It's not generative AI — it's a colleague."

---

# RISKS — PRE-REGISTERED

| Risk | Mitigation |
|---|---|
| Paper free-tier MCP call limit | Rehearse early; upgrade Pro on bite |
| Venue wifi dies | Hotspot; model call is the ONLY network dependency |
| Grok tool-call flakes | ui.py shows raw retry; manual tool call fallback |
| Paper MCP absent/closed | Announce once, render sandbox preview in ui.py instead |
| Time death | Cut order: Beat 4 → inspiration tool → ui.py polish. NEVER cut Beats 1–3 |

---

# ACCEPTANCE — DONE MEANS

- P1: `python agent.py` → one branded proposal visible on Paper canvas, logo + style.md colors + footer present. ✋ STOP AND SHOW JONATECH.
- P2: comment on canvas → "fix my comments" → both fixed, resolved, screenshot-verified; DECISIONS + LESSONS each have a dated new line.
- P3: kill + relaunch → new proposal carries the learned rule. PDF export works. Rehearsal ×3 done.

**Workflow per phase: build → smoke test → commit. One branch: `main`. Commit messages conventional (feat:/fix:).**

When ALL of P1–P3 (or P1–P2 + P3 partial with cuts documented) are done: mark this file's banner **CONSUMED** with the date, log the completion line in docs/EXECUTION_LOG.md, and report back to Jonatech with the demo checklist status.
